flowchart TD
  A[API Gateway] --> B[Standard middleware pipeline]
  B --> C[buildRequestContext]
  C --> D["fhirRequestTransform (optional)"]
  D --> E[Business Handler]
  E --> F["fhirResponseTransform (optional)"]
  F --> G["fhirSuccessResponse / successResponse"]
  B -.-> H["fhirErrorHandler (FhirValidationError → OperationOutcome)"]
